  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 400 (200).",
    "in a pan, heat the coconut oil over medium heat and saut\u00144 the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "add the cumin, coriander, chili powder, and cayenne pepper to the pan and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "in a separate pan, warm the black beans over low heat.",
    "in a large bowl, combine the almond flour, salt, and 1 cup of water to make a batter.",
    "add the batter to the oven-safe pan or tagliere and spread evenly.",
